                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/releases/tag/v3.58.0"&gt;3.58.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;Summary&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adds support for .NET 11&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Tracing] Add support for percent-encode literal % in W3C baggage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[CI Visibility] Add test automation exclusion attributes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[AAP] Redact URL attributes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Continuous Profiler] Add cpu_arch tag to profiles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[DBM] Propagate Oracle service hash through the session ACTION&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[FFE] Add split features, exposure verdicts and exposure hooks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Serverless] Add Azure FrontDoor support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Changes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Tracer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Tracer] Send Datadog-External-Env header to the agent (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5888081218" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9452" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9452/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9452"&gt;#9452&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Tracer] Give a new IIS AppDomain a new runtime ID when its AppDomainID is reused (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6160514876" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9577" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9577/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9577"&gt;#9577&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Tracer] Percent-encode literal % in W3C baggage (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6166441420" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9587" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9587/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9587"&gt;#9587&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Warm up gzip up at start (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6210313257" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9615" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9615/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9615"&gt;#9615&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[OTel] Remove OTEL_ENABLED and add OTEL_TRACES_EXPORTER in the startup log (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6117151272" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9564" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9564/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9564"&gt;#9564&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;CI Visibility&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[SDTEST-4054][SDTEST-4055][SDTEST-4056] Add test automation exclusion attributes (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6161829753" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9578" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9578/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9578"&gt;#9578&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
