&lt;li&gt;[CI Visibility] Fix coverage instrumentation of expression-bodied finalizers (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6305565770" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/9661" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9661/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/9661"&gt;#9661&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
